;; facts.edn — the outside facts inkan's README and site assert, each with the
;; source that settles it.
;;
;; Every :fact/source below was fetched on :fact/checked and returned HTTP 200,
;; and :fact/observed is what the body actually said (not what we expected it
;; to say). Re-check by fetching the URL; do not edit :fact/observed without
;; fetching.
;;
;; test/inkan/facts_test.cljk ties this file to the code: every font the site
;; (site/inkan/page.cljk), the preview page (scripts/preview.cljk) and the
;; geometry default (inkan.geometry/default-spec) can emit must have an OFL
;; fact here. Adding a font without its licence citation turns that test red —
;; the README's claim "いずれも OFL" is only as true as this file.
